WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
Slow cooling makes large crystals; fast cooling makes small ones.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:08.326
Magma cooling slowly, underground.

3
00:00:14.119 --> 00:00:18.144
Slow cooling gives fewer, larger crystals, like granite.

4
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.655
Very fast cooling at the surface gives many tiny crystals, like basalt.
